en in your life that u're unable 2step up. https:\/\/t.co\/gmxWhYHFkN","userId":6021962,"media":null,"username":"tummler10","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":57,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":954827176657989632,"date":1516483513000,"rawContent":"Right up there with @IvankaTrump saluting #TimesUp and #metoo. \n\nWe're marching AGAINST YOU. YOUR MISOGYNY. YOUR BIGOTRY. \n\nAnd... let's not forget, there are about 20 women who have alleged sexual harassment at the small hands of our Predator-in-Chief.\n\n#WomenMarch2018 https:\/\/t.co\/xZkbNkAfTp","userId":6021962,"media":null,"username":"tummler10","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":57,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":958554235481874432,"date":1517372113000,"rawContent":".@jaketapper Trump SAID he'd reach out to both sides of the aisle. Yet. It wasn't there IN the speech. So update your frame. It was bomb-throwing. To #BlackLivesMatter to climate change, to immigrants. #sotu","userId":6021962,"media":null,"username":"tummler10","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":58,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":958767710833401856,"date":1517423009000,"rawContent":"#MeToo \n\ncc @askpluto https:\/\/t.co\/d5N2HPCqyT